{"name":"Khalab","status":"ok","title":"Khalab","pageId":55343,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Khalab\" title=\"Category:Maps of Khalab\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Khalab</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murgh%C3%B4m\" title=\"Murghôm\">Murghôm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hordelands\" title=\"Hordelands\">Hordelands</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Khalab\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Khalab\">Inhabitants of  Khalab</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6TG9jYXRpb25zX2luX0toYWxhYj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Locations in Khalab (page does not exist)\">Locations in  Khalab</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9LaGFsYWI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Khalab (page does not exist)\">Organizations in  Khalab</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Khalab</b> was a small fishing village located in <a href=\"/wiki/Murgh%C3%B4m\" title=\"Murghôm\">Murghôm</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Location\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Location</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\">Location</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Location\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Location\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Khalab sat on the western banks of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Brightstar_Lake\" title=\"Brightstar Lake\">Gbor Nor</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Though the village was unremarkable, some considered the long trip to Khalab well worth the effort with the hopes of training under <a href=\"/wiki/Salid_Dhuzma\" title=\"Salid Dhuzma\">Salid Dhuzma</a>, a bard of great renown.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmFlbHp1ciUyN3NfVG93ZXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Baelzur's Tower (page does not exist)\">Baelzur's Tower</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Khalab?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-TH.VI-p64-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VI-p64_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/David_Cook\" title=\"David Cook\">David Cook</a> (August 1990). “Volume I”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Winter\" title=\"Steve Winter\">Steve Winter</a> ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Horde\" title=\"The Horde\">The Horde</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 64. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-868-4\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-868-4\">0-88038-868-4</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\